* Small-signal model of the OTA with the defect resistor R1 between the diode node F and the output (tail source open)
V1 in1 0 AC {v_1}
V2 in2 0 AC {v_2}
G1 f p in1 p {g_N}
RO1 f p {r_N}
G2 out p in2 p {g_N}
RO2 out p {r_N}
R3 f 0 {1/g_P}
RO3 f 0 {r_P}
G4 out 0 f 0 {g_P}
RO4 out 0 {r_P}
R1 f out {R_1}
.end
